Z||000000||Calab52||09-23-2001||10:49 PM||||Could someone explain to me why my decklid does not stay up by itself. What's the deal with torsion/springs etc.?||||reg||11
Z||000001||Hank is Here||09-23-2001||10:55 PM||||Have you added a wing?  If you did then that adds more weight than what the springs were designed for.  <BR>You can go to rodenydickman.com and he has gas struts to address this issue||||reg||1
